                                                "sense_id": "91417bc0-aeeb-3777-8702-856b7a2336fd",
                                                "text": "... she sits perched high up, astride a man's saddle, looking in her balloon garments, and doubtless feeling, more insecure than Humpty Dumpty on the wall."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28be57d8-fd67-44a6-9463-9322dfa3aae8",
                                                "sense_id": "91417bc0-aeeb-3777-8702-856b7a2336fd",
                                                "text": "For many people, traditional Christian theology is a Humpty-Dumpty: it has tumbled from its perch and can't be put together again."
                                            }
